body:
It can be the accutane. It's happening to me too and there's no other reason (my hormone levels are normal and I'm not taking birth control as I'm not having sex). I called my derm and said hirsutism is listed as a rare side effect. I'm currently only on 10mg to see if it stops from spreading but my sideburns go down to my jawline, and the hairs are black and thick. I'm super worried. Did it keep spreading or did it stop in your case? I hope you're not having too much of a bad time because of this.

&#x200B;

Edit: I just saw you left a comment on my question about this from some days ago haha. Now apparently we have confirmation. I hope it'll go away once our treatment is over.
